# Private infrastructure identifiers that must never be committed to this public repo.
#
# Copy this file to `.private-strings` (gitignored) and replace the examples below with
# your own real values. `.husky/pre-commit` reads it and rejects any staged change whose
# added lines match. One extended-regex pattern per line; `#` starts a comment.
#
# Do NOT put real values in this `.example` file - it is committed.

# Custom domains and their subdomains
your-domain\.example

# R2 bucket names
(prod|dev)-your-bucket-name

# Cloudflare worker / Pages project names
your-worker-name

# Cloudflare account ID
0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef
